":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113099","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113099","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113099.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113099.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-24T16:27:57Z"},"body":"Salvages #108497\r\n\r\nThis is a ~1:1~ copy of the changes that were reviewed and approved in the original PR, with minor code quality adjustments based on reviews from this thread.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n*Original PR description from @NathanLovato:*\r\n\r\n- Close #108496\r\n\r\nThis PR builds upon the BBCode to markdown conversion code written by geequlim 6 years ago to address its limitations. It currently follows the same approach of searching and replacing patterns to keep the implementation straightforward as discussed with @HolonProduction (it is, of course, open to change if needed).\r\n\r\nDone:\r\n\r\n- [x] Process all BBCode tags documented in the [GDScript documentation comments page](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.html#doc-gdscript-documentation-comments-bbcode-and-class-reference)\r\n- [x] Process the special `[codeblocks]` syntax for multiple code blocks in different languages\r\n- [x] Add unit test\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\n\r\n- I used this page from the documentation as a reference: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.html#doc-gdscript-documentation-comments-bbcode-and-class-reference\r\n- **Strikethrough:** I went with `~~` which one of the two supported [GitHub flavored markdown syntax](https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/writing-on-github/getting-started-with-writing-and-formatting-on-github/basic-writing-and-formatting-syntax). I tried using html tags but they're not supported in some code editors.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n- Close https://github.com/GDQuest/zed-gdscript/issues/42","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113099/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113099/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}